Third-party components

This package has no bundled third-party code. It depends on the following
packages at runtime, which are provided by the DeepSeek Harness host:

  @deepseek-ai/schemastery  (MIT)
  @deepseek-ai/cosmokit     (MIT, runtime dependency of schemastery)
  react                     (MIT)

All of the above use the MIT license and require no separate NOTICE file.
If an Apache-2.0 (or similarly NOTICE-bearing) license ever enters the direct
dependency list, a THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md must be added alongside this file.

The built-in prompt templates and style instructions shipped in lib/index.js
are original to this project and are covered by the MIT license above.
